        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> this is not a good design choice to force users to hack around the plugin for no good reason.\r\n\r\nNobody forces anyone to hack anything. 'mini.base16' is a color scheme generator that applies highlight groups based on the supplied hex colors. Support for 0-15 colors is secondary. This is a design choice aimed for an easier long term maintainability.",
